    <briefdescription>
<para>Uniform interface for TT-based approximate-nearest-neighbour indexes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All implementations must be thread-safe for concurrent reads (search, innerProduct, norm). Writes (add, remove) must be serialised externally or handled internally with a shared_mutex. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
